{"data": [{"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-10-26T06:40:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114608146010505244"], "id": "2114608146010505244", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1126, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 下午观点 | 沪指翻红摸到3699，创业板还趴着跌1.57%，这波是权重拖指数不是全市场回血\n\n兄弟们，14点40分，把数字摆清楚：上证3694.04，涨0.10%；深成指11544.68，跌1.11%；创业板2641.94，跌1.57%。这三个数放一起，就是今天下午的全部真相——指数看着还行，账户体感很差。\n\n▪️", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2114608146010505244"}, {"author_id": "1226862358707884032", "created_at": "2026-10-25T14:08:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114358330831606154"], "id": "2114358330831606154", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10月23日行情回顾\n早盘三大指数低开低走，上证指数盘中一度跌破3600点，最低探至约3574点（年内新低附近），创业板指盘中最大跌幅超3%。午后突然快速拉升，出现明显反转。⁠21jingji\n\n收盘情况：\n\n上证指数：3690.48点，+0.89%\n深证成指：11673.83点，+2.79%\n创业板指：2684.10点，+4.16%", "url": "https://x.com/hagimix/status/2114358330831606154"}, {"author_id": "2024254964324061186", "created_at": "2026-10-26T00:57:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114521812822556958"], "id": "2114521812822556958", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 133, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "早盘预测 10/26｜先交上周成绩单：2/10。\n\n周一到周四每天 0/2，周五 2/2。前四天一直押超跌反弹，结果在单边下跌里接了四天刀，周五创业板涨 4.16% 结束 9 连跌才对上两条。记下的教训：趋势还在往下、离均线又远的时候，超跌统计不能单独拿来押。\n\n周五的盘有点特别。周四全市场只有 535 家涨（不到", "url": "https://x.com/Sylar76529/status/2114521812822556958"}, {"author_id": "1128198342859563008", "created_at": "2026-10-26T12:33:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114696809654505536"], "id": "2114696809654505536", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 129, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GS 中国收盘速览\n\n📊 上证综指上涨 0.19%，科创 50 下跌 2.23%。\n📊 上证 50 上涨 0.41%，创业板指下跌 1.71%。\n📊 沪深 300 下跌 0.04%，中证 500 下跌 1.49%。\n💴 全天成交总额 1.62 万亿元，较前一日下降 17.73%。\n📌 A 股各大指数收盘表现分化。上证综指在临近早盘收盘阶段拉升，最终收涨 19", "url": "https://x.com/ming69621583/status/2114696809654505536"}, {"author_id": "2060298489305890816", "created_at": "2026-10-26T07:10:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114615527507366257"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/qdPY3sKLSz", "end": 34, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2114615527507366257/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114615513188085760", "start": 11, "url": "https://t.co/qdPY3sKLSz"}]}, "id": "2114615527507366257", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "收盘了，脸都不要了。 https://t.co/qdPY3sKLSz", "url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2114615527507366257"}, {"author_id": "1945259172574191616", "created_at": "2026-10-25T06:12:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114238632915591626"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 3, "start": 0, "tag": "A股"}, {"end": 9, "start": 4, "tag": "上证指数"}, {"end": 13, "start": 10, "tag": "美股"}]}, "id": "2114238632915591626", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2025, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#A股 #上证指数 #美股 \n\n别猜了！周五超跌反弹的真相，数据早已说明一切", "url": "https://x.com/ConcettaTy54805/status/2114238632915591626"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-10-26T02:37:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114547031805214848"], "id": "2114547031805214848", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 502, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 开盘速报 | 周一低开下杀，创业板重挫近2.9%，机器人成全场独苗\n\n▪️", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2114547031805214848"}, {"author_id": "2062811475446779905", "created_at": "2026-10-26T11:29:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114680896662217034"], "id": "2114680896662217034", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 63, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📈 10.26 复盘｜缩量到 1.61 万亿，上证贴五日微涨，成长回吐、消费油气护盘\n\n【量能】\n两市成交 16,088 亿（上证 7,465 + 深证综指口径 8,623），比上周五少 3,475 亿（-17.8%）。周五好不容易冲到 1.96 万亿，今天又掉回 1.61 万亿，离 1.8 万亿门槛还差约 1,900", "url": "https://x.com/Leodozqa/status/2114680896662217034"}, {"author_id": "541462295", "created_at": "2026-10-25T07:37:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114260103524426079"], "id": "2114260103524426079", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 810, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "周五三大指数集体低开，一路下杀，沪指开盘跳空低开，最深一度跌超2%，创业板更是暴跌3个点以上，满屏“绿色森林”，就在绝望之时，抄底承接资金进场，午后直接开启大反攻，V型反转的剧本，走出一波经典探底回升行情，截至收盘，沪指收3690.48（+0.89%），创指火力拉满大涨4.16%，科创50涨3.04%，两市成", "url": "https://x.com/zhaoge168/status/2114260103524426079"}, {"author_id": "51315943", "created_at": "2026-10-26T04:08:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114569927046963494"], "id": "2114569927046963494", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 200, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股三大指数今日低开震荡，截至午间收盘，上证指数跌0.18%，深证成指跌1.05%，创业板指跌1.65%。沪深两市半日成交额1.01万亿，较上个交易日缩量619亿。盘面上，全市场超2400只个股上涨。房地产板块走强，招商蛇口、大名城涨停。石油天然气、海运、白酒、游戏等板块涨幅居前。贵金属板块调整，赤峰黄金", "url": "https://x.com/lifeofchives/status/2114569927046963494"}, {"author_id": "51315943", "created_at": "2026-10-26T07:11:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114615855770374625"], "id": "2114615855770374625", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 85, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 10月26日A股收盘分析\n\nA股三大指数涨跌不一，上证指数+0.19%，深证成指-1.19%，创业板指-1.71%。两市成交额1.61万亿元，缩量3475亿元，超3100只个股下跌。\n\n🛢️ 石油天然气板块强势领涨，机器人概念冲高回落；半导体、贵金属板块走弱。", "url": "https://x.com/lifeofchives/status/2114615855770374625"}, {"author_id": "2108191189019381760", "created_at": "2026-10-26T07:53:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114626343736578479"], "id": "2114626343736578479", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 379, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📑📌高盛中国午评\n\n📈指数行情\n上证指数 -0.18%;上证 50 -0.59%\n深证成指 -1.05%;创业板指 -1.65%\n成交额 1.02 万亿元人民币;较上一交易日下降 15%\n🌏盘面简述\n受油价飙升、大型科技股财报披露前夕的影响,A", "url": "https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2114626343736578479"}, {"author_id": "921529844", "created_at": "2026-10-26T09:50:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114655903622533217"], "id": "2114655903622533217", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 140, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 10月26日A股收评：沪指勉强翻红，创业板跌超1%，科技股调整何时结束？\n\n今天A股走出了明显的分化行情！\n\n截至收盘，上证指数上涨0.19%，报3697.52点；深证成指下跌1.19%，创业板指下跌1.71%。两市成交额约1.61万亿元，较上一交易日缩量约3475亿元，全市场超过3100只个股下跌。\n\n📉", "url": "https://x.com/rota_maria/status/2114655903622533217"}, {"author_id": "1965617345487142915", "created_at": "2026-10-26T07:26:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114619595252490520"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 3, "start": 0, "tag": "A股"}, {"end": 9, "start": 4, "tag": "收评复盘"}, {"end": 16, "start": 11, "tag": "实盘复盘"}]}, "id": "2114619595252490520", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#A股 #收评复盘  #实盘复盘\n\n收评复盘：收盘了。今天这盘面，真是把人性的“割裂”玩到了极致。\n\n上证微红，创业板却跌了快2%。全市场3100多家下跌，最关键的是，两市成交额比上周五直接缩水了3400多亿！\n\n今天盘面有多“魔幻”：\n\n1、 “老大哥”创了18年新高：", "url": "https://x.com/betty7852212512/status/2114619595252490520"}, {"author_id": "1128198342859563008", "created_at": "2026-10-26T04:50:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114580372449313165"], "id": "2114580372449313165", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 206, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📑📌高盛中国午评 \n\n📈指数行情\n上证指数 -0.18%；上证 50 -0.59%\n深证成指 -1.05%；创业板指 -1.65%\n成交额 1.02 万亿元人民币；较上一交易日下降 15%\n🌏盘面简述\n受油价飙升、大型科技股财报披露前夕的影响，A", "url": "https://x.com/ming69621583/status/2114580372449313165"}, {"author_id": "852245268389126144", "created_at": "2026-10-26T01:11:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114525336285368420"], "id": "2114525336285368420", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 787, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "兄弟们早上好！先看隔夜外围\n\n上周五美股整体走弱，三大指数收跌，纳指偏弱，AI科技龙头分化，资金有兑现压力。美债收益率高位反复，油价波动，通胀预期还没完全落地，市场情绪偏谨慎，外围这边暂时没有形成强带动效应。", "url": "https://x.com/Jwaher49783608/status/2114525336285368420"}, {"author_id": "921529844", "created_at": "2026-10-26T04:56:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114581970030145882"], "id": "2114581970030145882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 264, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 A股午间股评：三大指数集体调整，AI硬件承压，机器人与消费逆势活跃！", "url": "https://x.com/rota_maria/status/2114581970030145882"}, {"author_id": "1846119743188881408", "created_at": "2026-10-26T15:58:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114748469911105644"], "id": "2114748469911105644", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 156, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天大盘收涨，许多人账户估计还是飘绿的。\n\n沪指收涨0.19%，看着还不错，但创业板指跌了1.71%，科创50跌了2.23%，成交额缩量了将近3500亿。下跌家数超过3000家。指数是石油、银行这几个大块头硬撑起来的，多数个股在失血。", "url": "https://x.com/lubianlaozhao/status/2114748469911105644"}, {"author_id": "1339603429", "created_at": "2026-10-25T06:12:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114238587621290206"], "id": "2114238587621290206", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 4867, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今日股市！利好利空消息！对应板块！美股芯片走强！\n\n利好\n1. 央行10月26日开展7000亿1年期MLF操作 \n利好：银行、地产、基建、高股息，成长板块（算力、半导体）流动性环境改善预期。\n\n2. 外汇局发布跨境投融资便利化政策征求意见稿 \n利好：跨境金融、券商、外资偏好核心资产、出海产业链。\n\n3.", "url": "https://x.com/carla121100/status/2114238587621290206"}, {"author_id": "142922148603